DEPENDENCY DEFERRAL — why the two xcodebuild scheme steps are DEFERRED (not green)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
REPRODUCED (not assumed). Building the app target on this host fails deterministically:

  $ xcodebuild -project TeslaSync.xcodeproj -target TeslaSync -sdk iphonesimulator build
  error: There is no XCFramework found at
         '.../apps/apple/Frameworks/Shared.xcframework'. (in target 'TeslaSync')
  BUILD_RESULT=65

The TeslaSync iOS/macOS app targets link the KMP `Shared.xcframework` (ADR-004). Staging it
requires the Kotlin/Native Apple toolchain via `apps/shared/gradlew :core:assembleSharedXCFramework`
(a scheme pre-build phase). `apps/macos-pending-verifications.md` explicitly defers this artifact to
the `macos-latest` CI runners (origin S3-0001 -> H8-0001 / P99-0001). Staging it here under the heavy
concurrent Gradle-daemon load of the sibling parallel slots is the documented long-pole and was not
attempted to avoid disrupting co-tenant builds. This is a pre-existing, environment/integration
dependency — NOT a defect in this surface.

Scope note: in this slot `struct DashboardWidgetSize` / `DashboardWidgetRegistration` is defined
exactly ONCE (Sources/DashboardWidgets/DashboardWidgetInfra.swift); CostBreakdownWidget.* adds no
redefinition. Per project.yml the co-located *Tests.swift are excluded from the app target and
compiled only into the XCTest bundles, so they introduce no app-target import of XCTest. The
per-surface CostBreakdownWidget.strings is folded into the app Localizable.xcstrings at integration
time and is intentionally NOT self-registered (the shared catalog + dashboard grid + the pending-
verifications doc are outside this surface's allowed file scope).

Net: the full-app `xcodebuild build test` is DEFERRED to the signed macos-latest acceptance gate
(P99-0001), matching the disposition of all sibling P4 dashboard-widget surfaces. The surface itself
is proven GREEN by [B]/[C]/[D] against the real design system + Swift 6 strict concurrency.

